      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like im drowning and everyone else is getting pulled under with me. my wife is working two jobs just to cover the debt i racked up and my kids... they don't even have new shoes because i keep messing everything up. i've been doing the math in my head all night. if i wasn't here, the expenses would stop. the house would be stable. it just feels like i'm a weight pulling them down into the dirt.",
