      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i'm hurting them by staying. i've spent my whole life thinking being there for people is what matters, but right now, my \"being there\" is literally costing them their future. it's like i'm just an anchor. you say it's not selfish, but how is it selfish to want to remove the source of the stress? it feels like i'm just choosing between my own fear of dying and their ability to actually live.",
